## Did gluetun pick from the refreshed list without a restart?
Of the 16 distinct server IPs gluetun attempted in this container (startup, then 10 Rotations in q3-rotation-tcp-flags.log):
- 3 exist only in the bundled list: the three startup picks, made before the update;
- 11 exist only in the refreshed list: every pick after the update;
- 2 are in both.
So the update applied to the next pick, with no restart.
